#: ../../genrst/builtin_types.rst:721
msgid ""
"Range arguments must fit in a machine word; large start or stop values "
"misbehave."
msgstr ""
"range 引数はマシンワード内に収まる必要がある。開始値または終了値が大きすぎる"
"と正しく動作しない。"

#: ../../genrst/builtin_types.rst:723
msgid ""
"**Cause:** Range stores its arguments as the C mp_int_t type, and "
"intermediate calculations also use it."
msgstr ""
"**原因:** range 関数は引数をC言語の mp_int_t 型として格納し、中間計算でもこの"
"型が使われるため。"

#: ../../genrst/builtin_types.rst:725
msgid "**Workaround:** Avoid using such ranges"
msgstr "**回避策:** そのような range 関数の使用を避けてください。"

#: ../../genrst/builtin_types.rst:730
msgid ""
"from sys import maxsize\n"
"\n"
"# A range including `maxsize-1` cannot be created\n"
"try:\n"
"    print(range(-maxsize - 1, 0))\n"
"except OverflowError:\n"
"    print(\"OverflowError\")\n"
"\n"
"# A range with start or stop outside [-maxsize, maxsize] cannot be created, even if the range itself would be small.\n"
"try:\n"
"    print(range(maxsize + 1, maxsize + 2))\n"
"except OverflowError:\n"
"    print(\"OverflowError\")\n"
"\n"
"# A range with `stop-start` exceeding sys.maxsize has incorrect len(), while CPython cannot calculate len().\n"
"try:\n"
"    print(len(range(-maxsize, maxsize)))\n"
"except OverflowError:\n"
"    print(\"OverflowError\")\n"
"\n"
"# A range with `stop-start` exceeding sys.maxsize has incorrect len()\n"
"try:\n"
"    print(len(range(-maxsize, maxsize, maxsize)))\n"
"except OverflowError:\n"
"    print(\"OverflowError\")"
msgstr ""
"from sys import maxsize\n"
"\n"
"# `maxsize-1` を含む range は作成できません\n"
"try:\n"
"    print(range(-maxsize - 1, 0))\n"
"except OverflowError:\n"
"    print(\"OverflowError\")\n"
"\n"
"# start や stop が [-maxsize, maxsize] の外にある range は、range 自体が小さくても作成できません。\n"
"try:\n"
"    print(range(maxsize + 1, maxsize + 2))\n"
"except OverflowError:\n"
"    print(\"OverflowError\")\n"
"\n"
"# `stop-start` が sys.maxsize を超える range では len() が正しくありません。一方 CPython では len() を計算できません。\n"
"try:\n"
"    print(len(range(-maxsize, maxsize)))\n"
"except OverflowError:\n"
"    print(\"OverflowError\")\n"
"\n"
"# `stop-start` が sys.maxsize を超える range では len() が正しくありません\n"
"try:\n"
"    print(len(range(-maxsize, maxsize, maxsize)))\n"
"except OverflowError:\n"
"    print(\"OverflowError\")"

