#: ../../genrst/syntax.rst:4
msgid "Syntax"
msgstr "構文"

#: ../../genrst/syntax.rst:10
msgid "Annotations"
msgstr "アノテーション"

#: ../../genrst/syntax.rst:15
msgid ""
"MicroPython accepts type annotations on expressions where CPython forbids "
"them."
msgstr "MicroPythonは、CPython では禁止されている式への型注釈を受け入れる。"

#: ../../genrst/syntax.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Cause:** To reduce code size, MicroPython does not check the form of "
"expressions with type annotations applied."
msgstr ""
"**原因:** コードサイズを削減するため、MicroPython は型注釈が適用された式の形"
"式をチェックしません。"

#: ../../genrst/syntax.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Workaround:** Always check for valid Python code using a linting tool."
msgstr ""
"**回避策:** リンティングツールを使用して、常に有効な Python コードであること"
"を確認してください。"

#: ../../genrst/syntax.rst:21
msgid "The expressions themselves are not evaluated."
msgstr "式自体は評価されません。"

#: ../../genrst/syntax.rst:27
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"def test(expr):\n"
"    code = f\"def f():\\n    {expr}: int\"\n"
"    print(code)\n"
"    try:\n"
"        exec(code)\n"
"        print(\"OK\")\n"
"    except SyntaxError as e:\n"
"        print(\"SyntaxError\")\n"
"    print()\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"test(\"print('test')\")\n"
"test(\"[x,y]\")\n"
"test(\"x,y\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../genrst/syntax.rst:47
msgid ""
"def f():\n"
"    print('test'): int\n"
"SyntaxError\n"
"\n"
"def f():\n"
"    [x,y]: int\n"
"SyntaxError\n"
"\n"
"def f():\n"
"    x,y: int\n"
"SyntaxError"
msgstr ""

#: ../../genrst/syntax.rst:47
msgid ""
"def f():\n"
"    print('test'): int\n"
"OK\n"
"\n"
"def f():\n"
"    [x,y]: int\n"
"OK\n"
"\n"
"def f():\n"
"    x,y: int\n"
"OK"
msgstr ""

#: ../../genrst/syntax.rst:61
msgid "Literals"
msgstr "リテラル"

#: ../../genrst/syntax.rst:66
msgid ""
"MicroPython accepts underscores in numeric literals where CPython doesn't"
msgstr ""
"CPython が数値リテラルで受け入れないアンダースコアを MicroPython は受け入れる"

#: ../../genrst/syntax.rst:68 ../../genrst/syntax.rst:101
msgid "**Cause:** Different parser implementation"
msgstr "**原因:** パーサーの実装の違い。"

#: ../../genrst/syntax.rst:70
msgid ""
"MicroPython's tokenizer ignores underscores in numeric literals, while "
"CPython rejects multiple consecutive underscores and underscores after the "
"last digit."
msgstr ""
"MicroPython のトークナイザーは数値リテラル内のアンダースコアを無視しますが、"
"CPython は連続する複数のアンダースコアと最後の桁の後のアンダースコアを拒否し"
"ます。"

#: ../../genrst/syntax.rst:73
msgid "**Workaround:** Remove the underscores not accepted by CPython."
msgstr "**回避策:** CPython で受け入れられないアンダースコアを削除します。"

#: ../../genrst/syntax.rst:78
msgid ""
"try:\n"
"    print(eval(\"1__1\"))\n"
"except SyntaxError:\n"
"    print(\"Should not work\")\n"
"try:\n"
"    print(eval(\"1_\"))\n"
"except SyntaxError:\n"
"    print(\"Should not work\")"
msgstr ""

